    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918940/extras/d750281efa67df565fe55e59a7701ff9.poster.avif?t=1716305586\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918940/extras/d750281efa67df565fe55e59a7701ff9.webm?t=1716305586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918940/extras/d750281efa67df565fe55e59a7701ff9.mp4?t=1716305586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f<br><br><strong>Blumgi Soccer</strong>: Pure Gameplay &amp; Physics!<br><br><strong>Blumgi Soccer </strong>strips everything back to what matters most: instant action and fun. No stories, intros, or complex menus. Just launch and play!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Instant Action:</strong> Open the game, and you\u2019re directly on the field.<br></li><li><strong>Physics-Driven:</strong> Master the ball with physics; score before running out of shots.<br></li><li><strong>Creative Play:</strong> Whether it's with strategy or brute force, make your way through defenders and obstacles in unique styles.<br></li><li><strong>Interactive World: </strong>Use everything from seagulls to giant balls to outsmart the opposition.<br></li><li><strong>100 Short Levels:</strong> A continuous stream of vibrant challenges awaits.</li></ul><br>Blumgi Soccer is soccer at its most fun and imaginative. Ready to kick it?",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918940/extras/d750281efa67df565fe55e59a7701ff9.poster.avif?t=1716305586\" width=640 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918940/extras/d750281efa67df565fe55e59a7701ff9.webm?t=1716305586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2918940/extras/d750281efa67df565fe55e59a7701ff9.mp4?t=1716305586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f  \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f<br><br><strong>Blumgi Soccer</strong>: Pure Gameplay &amp; Physics!<br><br><strong>Blumgi Soccer </strong>strips everything back to what matters most: instant action and fun. No stories, intros, or complex menus. Just launch and play!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Instant Action:</strong> Open the game, and you\u2019re directly on the field.<br></li><li><strong>Physics-Driven:</strong> Master the ball with physics; score before running out of shots.<br></li><li><strong>Creative Play:</strong> Whether it's with strategy or brute force, make your way through defenders and obstacles in unique styles.<br></li><li><strong>Interactive World: </strong>Use everything from seagulls to giant balls to outsmart the opposition.<br></li><li><strong>100 Short Levels:</strong> A continuous stream of vibrant challenges awaits.</li></ul><br>Blumgi Soccer is soccer at its most fun and imaginative. Ready to kick it?",
    "short_description": "Blumgi Soccer offers a refreshing take on soccer. With big kicks and a dynamic physics system, every level invites you to strategize, kick, and score in ways you've never imagined. Get ready for a soccer experience like no other!",
